{
  "name": "Vero - Base de conhecimento (CRM)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Base de conhecimento do CRM\nTodo dia às 3h (ou em **Executar fluxo**), copia para a base da IA (tabela **vero_conhecimento** no Postgres da VPS):\n- a base da IA do CRM (perguntas, objeções, dicas e mensagens);\n- o critério de fit e as orientações do agente;\n- as transcrições das R1, se o administrador ligar no CRM (sem nome, telefone, e-mail e CPF).\nA cópia anterior do CRM é trocada pela nova (os arquivos do Google Drive ficam).",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "29495d81-62a0-4e67-a1c4-dc2e12ee98e9",
      "name": "Leia-me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 3 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "acf7c47f-0a4b-4088-a9c9-62c8c5880b14",
      "name": "Todo dia às 3h",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -400,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "1fa79bf3-2c5b-4a92-aca7-8ec7ba5fedd1",
      "name": "Executar agora",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -400,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "208729ad-f5af-48ab-a937-53afc35358ee",
              "name": "crm_url",
              "value": "https://SEU-CRM.com.br",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "500aeeb3-6a83-4daf-a293-216e15d0334d",
      "name": "Configuração",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.crm_url.replace(/\\/+$/, \"\") }}/api/integracoes/n8n/conhecimento",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "b2de8f42-b9e7-4986-a00c-b2b0f20cc01b",
      "name": "CRM - Base de conhecimento",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        40,
        80
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "VeroCrmToken0001",
          "name": "CRM Vero (token do n8n)"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "DO $$ BEGIN IF to_regclass('public.vero_conhecimento') IS NOT NULL THEN DELETE FROM vero_conhecimento WHERE metadata->>'fonte' = 'crm'; END IF; END $$;",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f9e22909-df33-4f10-a095-f2bb859b3298",
      "name": "Apagar a cópia anterior",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        260,
        80
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "VeroPostgres0001",
          "name": "Postgres da VPS (base de conhecimento)"
        }
      },
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Um item por documento do CRM\nreturn $('CRM - Base de conhecimento').first().json.documentos.map((d) => ({ json: d }));"
      },
      "id": "fa63930a-540c-46da-a5e6-775cf810d942",
      "name": "Um item por documento",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "insert",
        "tableName": "vero_conhecimento",
        "embeddingBatchSize": 50,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "057facff-3c39-4270-afc0-5233a3875ccf",
      "name": "Guardar na base",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStorePGVector",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        720,
        80
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "VeroPostgres0001",
          "name": "Postgres da VPS (base de conhecimento)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-embedding-001"
      },
      "id": "e5ab7ab9-8022-4a73-ad21-78c229f92825",
      "name": "Embeddings Gemini",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.embeddingsGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
